post.summary:
Receives a Sonarr or Radarr webhook call. Authenticated by the
integration's token (Basic auth's password, or Bearer), not a session;
every failure to authenticate is the same `401 login_required`.

pack_conditions.description:
Conditions of the pack-version state for the Filters & Safety
notice (`packs.lost`, `packs.differ`, `packs.skipped.MW-2`, …);
empty when there's nothing to report.

credential_spec.description:
The credentials its plugin reads, in the order to ask for them;
empty for a source that reads none. It describes the fields, never
a value.

SourcePatch.description:
`PATCH /sources/{id}`. Fields left out keep their values. A new
priority applies at once, and disabling stops the source at once;
enabling takes effect at the next start (`restart_required`).
